# Hill Stream — what does not belong in the published repository.
#
# The site itself is static: index.html, the .dc.html pages, the shared
# modules and uploads/photos are all tracked, so GitHub Pages can serve the
# demo. What is excluded below is either a secret, local state, or scratch
# that nothing on the site loads.


# ── Secrets and live data ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# hillstream.db is not just data. server.js generates the JWT signing key,
# the reset salt and the reset-code digest on first run and stores them
# here (server.js:41-46), alongside the operator's password digest and the
# guest book. Publishing it would hand over the keys to the property.
# The server recreates it, and reseeds the owner account, on next start.
hillstream.db
hillstream.db-wal
hillstream.db-shm
hillstream.db-journal
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal

# Anything holding credentials for a real deployment.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example


# ── Local editor state ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The <image-slot> drop sidecar: ~2 MB of base64 holding the same pictures
# that now live as real files in uploads/photos, which every slot points at
# via src. The site renders identically without it — and server.js refuses
# to serve dot-files anyway, so it never reached the browser.
# Delete this line if you would rather version the drops.
.image-slots.state.json
.thumbnail


# ── Scratch the site never loads ─────────────────────────────────────────
# 73 paste artefacts and window grabs (~20 MB) left over from building the
# pages — screenshots of the site and the PMS, not photographs of the
# resort. Nothing references them. The real photography is uploads/photos
# and the four ChatGPT source images, which stay tracked.
uploads/pasted-*.png
uploads/Screenshot*.png

# Two clips no page plays (~18 MB). Every video the site actually uses —
# the six home-page clips, the gallery reel and the header mark — is
# tracked. Remove these two lines if you want the spares kept.
uploads/Video Project (1).mp4
uploads/make_it_more_pefect_adn_beauti.mp4


# ── Node ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.npm/


# ── OS and editor ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
